### 06. Master Data API Requests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@authToken = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "angel@unggul.co.id",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Get Master Entries (Departemen)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/master/dept
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get Master Entries (Posisi)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/master/pos
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Create Master Entry
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/master/dept
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Departemen HSE Baru",
  "active": true
}
